= Ubik

 The best way to ask for beer is to sing out Ubik. Made from select
 hops, choice water, slow-aged for perfect flavor, Ubik is the nation’s
 number-one choice in beer. Made only in Cleveland

- @purchase: Buy Ubik.
- @root: Do nothing.

